// The Campaign (GDD, section 4): region 1, Plain of Menhirs (stages 1-20, no battle rule: teaches the basics);
// region 2, Drowned Archipelago (21-40, mostly Water: elements and effects, boss at 40); region 3, Citadel of the
// Broken Seal (41-50, Light and Dark, boss at 50). Beating stage 50 is where an account is ready for the Dungeons:
// it takes about level 20 with runes, or 6★ level 40 without them (Tests: dotnet run --project Tests -- --simulate).
// Enemies at the stage stars and level ("stars", "level"): "summon" is a summon variant from Data/summons (buffed for the fight),
// "enemy" a unique creature from Data/enemies.json with its "element". "scale" multiplies the enemies' HP and Attack:
// it is the calibration of each stage, so that heavier waves don't need a level that lies about them.
// "mana" is the cost of each victory (a defeat costs nothing). Scrolls only
// on the first victory; Essence and experience (per team monster, on the Summoners War scale; the account gets the same) on every victory. The rune
// (up to 4 stars) always drops on the first victory and with a 50% chance on later ones. 5 and 6 star
// runes and the tools come from the Dungeons (Data/dungeons.json).
